* ===========================================================================
* VOLTAGE-CONTROLLED OSCILLATOR (VCO)
* ===========================================================================
* LC-VCO modeled with XSPICE d_osc element.
* Piecewise-linear voltage-to-frequency characteristic.
*
* Kvco = 10 MHz/V (low Kvco for minimum phase noise)
* Coarse capacitor bank selects correct band at startup
* Fine varactor provides 10 MHz/V continuous tuning
*
* Center frequency: 2.4 GHz at Vctrl = Vco_center = 1.65V
*
* Frequency mapping:
*   f_out = 2.4 GHz + 10M * (Vctrl - 1.65)
*   V=0.0V  -> 2.3835 GHz
*   V=0.5V  -> 2.3885 GHz
*   V=1.0V  -> 2.3935 GHz
*   V=1.65V -> 2.4000 GHz
*   V=2.0V  -> 2.4035 GHz
*   V=2.5V  -> 2.4085 GHz
*   V=3.0V  -> 2.4135 GHz
*   V=3.3V  -> 2.4165 GHz
* ===========================================================================

avco ctrl d_vco vco_model
.model vco_model d_osc(cntl_array=[0.0 0.5 1.0 1.65 2.0 2.5 3.0 3.3]
+ freq_array=[2.3835e9 2.3885e9 2.3935e9 2.4e9 2.4035e9 2.4085e9 2.4135e9 2.4165e9]
+ duty_cycle=0.5 init_phase=0
+ rise_delay=0.05n fall_delay=0.05n)
